  "post_content": "<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">(12 fotos) El salon de actos del Centro de Empleo y Cultura de Onda ha acogido estejueves el curso de iniciaci&oacute;n Nuevas tendencias en comercio y distribuci&oacute;n: Posibilidades para PYMES de comercial al por menor, organizado por la asociaci&oacute;n Onda Centre Comercial.</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/02/IMG_0160.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">El ponente ha sido Jes&uacute;s Gonz&aacute;lez Feliu, ingeniero industrial de Onda, docente-investigador en el Institut Henri Fayol, Ecole de Mines de Saint-Etienne (Francia) e ingeniero civil del INSA de Lyon.</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradajesusgonzalezfeliuocc/img_0160.jpg\" alt=\"img_0160\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradajesusgonzalezfeliuocc/img_0163.jpg\" alt=\"img_0163\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradajesusgonzalezfeliuocc/img_0164.jpg\" alt=\"img_0164\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradajesusgonzalezfeliuocc/img_0165.jpg\" alt=\"img_0165\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradajesusgonzalezfeliuocc/img_0166.jpg\" alt=\"img_0166\" style=\"max-width:100